{"message":"fix(community): ThreadPanel had no reply composer -- forum post replies were unreachable\n\nThreadPanel (cm-thread-panel) only ever rendered a select/create/close list,\nwith zero reply-composer surface. zellous's threadManager.replyToForumPost\nexisted at the bridge layer but had no live caller anywhere in the SDK's\nrendered tree -- replying to a forum post (kind:1111 NIP-22) was fully\nunreachable through the UI despite the protocol/adapter plumbing being real.\n\nAdd opt-in onReply prop to ThreadPanel: when provided, docks a text input +\nsend button under the thread list (Icon('send'), .cm-tp-reply-input focus\nring, matches the kit's existing composer language). Omitted (plain\nthreaded-channel usage) renders identically to before -- no regression.\n\nLive-witnessed against a local build of the SDK bundle: typing + submitting\ncorrectly invokes adapter.actions.replyToThread(text).\n\nSESSION_ID=pages-forum-landing-1789939891","SESSION_ID":"pages-forum-landing-1789939891"}
